            The poignant story of the free will
            Throughout the history of humankind, human-being had established different types of human bonds which consist of a number of people whose intentions are alike. Indeed, from tribal society to industrial revolution, the heads of these bonds used to be an alpha male whose physical strength is undefeatable. it is impossible to build so-called institutions ruled by one hierarchy (physical power). There is something else can be vital supplement to reinforce social order in society is spiritual belief. Similarly, Ancient Greek Pantheon required to lean columns not to fall into the ground and being demolished by imbalance. As I mentioned above, Physical strength like weaponized troops, vicious mercenary groups alongside with spiritual faith like religion, love and hatred forwarded to the enemies are important columns of society. 
